      "type": "section",
      "text": "CMI — Insurance Data Sharing Requirements > Dashboard — tabs\n\nThe dashboard must present Insurance Data Sharing consents across two tabs.\n\n# | Rule\n1 | The Current\n tab must display all consents whose status is AwaitingAuthorization\n, Authorized\n, Suspended\n, or Paused\n.\n2 | The History\n tab must display all consents whose status is Rejected\n, Expired\n, or Revoked\n.",
