      "text": "CMI — Insurance Data Sharing Requirements > Dashboard — card content\n\nEach Insurance Data Sharing consent card on the dashboard must show the following fields.\n\nField | Content\nLFI name | Name of the LFI the consent is held with\nStatus badge | Mapped label from Status labels\nPolicy count | Number of connected policies, e.g. 1 Policy Connected\n or 2 Policies Connected\nConsent Type | Data Sharing\nLast data received | Date the most recent data was retrieved under this consent\nConnection expires | Date the consent expires",
